<title>BELGIUM: SPECTOR TO STRIP VVPR SHARES.</title>
<headline>SPECTOR TO STRIP VVPR SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian photo finishing group Spector NV said on Friday it would allow the tax advantage on its 524,873 reduced withholding tax &quot;VVPR&quot; shares to be traded separately as strips.</p>
<p>Spector said the operation would start on October 4.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
